*(Lưu ý: Hệ thống chỉ cung cấp thông tin giáo dục y tế và hỗ trợ sàng lọc. Mọi quyết định chẩn đoán và điều trị cần dựa trên chỉ định của Bác sĩ chuyên khoa.)*','{"intent": "measurement_concern", "active_agents": ["patient_context_agent", "monitoring_agent", "knowledge_agent", "lifestyle_advisor_agent", "safety_agent"], "timeline": [{"agent_id": "patient_context_agent", "agent_name": "Patient Context Agent", "status": "SUCCESS", "duration_ms": 5.0, "action_summary": "\u0110\u00e3 n\u1ea1p h\u1ed3 s\u01a1: Gi\u1edbi t\u00ednh Male, BMI 25.95, Huy\u1ebft \u00e1p cao: C\u00f3, \u0110\u01b0\u1eddng huy\u1ebft g\u1ea7n nh\u1ea5t: 62.0 mg/dL.", "output_preview": "\u0110\u00e3 n\u1ea1p h\u1ed3 s\u01a1: Gi\u1edbi t\u00ednh Male, BMI 25.95, Huy\u1ebft \u00e1p cao: C\u00f3, \u0110\u01b0\u1eddng huy\u1ebft g\u1ea7n nh\u1ea5t: 62.0 mg/dL."}, {"agent_id": "monitoring_agent", "agent_name": "Monitoring Agent", "status": "SUCCESS", "duration_ms": 0.0, "action_summary": "K\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 gi\u00e1m s\u00e1t \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng huy\u1ebft (165.0 mg/dL): DIABETES - \u0110\u01b0\u1eddng huy\u1ebft \u0111\u00f3i cao (>= 126 mg/dL - Ng\u01b0\u1ee1ng \u0110\u00e1i th\u00e1o \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng theo ADA).", "output_preview": "K\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 gi\u00e1m s\u00e1t \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng huy\u1ebft (165.0 mg/dL): DIABETES - \u0110\u01b0\u1eddng huy\u1ebft \u0111\u00f3i cao (>= 126 mg/dL - Ng\u01b0\u1ee1ng \u0110\u00e1i th\u00e1o \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng theo ADA)."}, {"agent_id": "knowledge_agent", "agent_name": "Knowledge Agent", "status": "SUCCESS", "duration_ms": 7.0, "action_summary": "RAG \u0111\u00e3 tr\u00edch xu\u1ea5t 2 \u0111o\u1ea1n tri th\u1ee9c ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p t\u1eeb c\u00e1c ngu\u1ed3n y khoa chu\u1ea9n (WHO/ADA).", "output_preview": "RAG \u0111\u00e3 tr\u00edch xu\u1ea5t 2 \u0111o\u1ea1n tri th\u1ee9c ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p t\u1eeb c\u00e1c ngu\u1ed3n y khoa chu\u1ea9n (WHO/ADA)."}, {"agent_id": "lifestyle_advisor_agent", "agent_name": "Lifestyle Advisor Agent", "status": "SUCCESS", "duration_ms": 0.0, "action_summary": "\u0110\u00e3 chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb 3 khuy\u1ebfn ngh\u1ecb gi\u00e1o d\u1ee5c l\u1ed1i s\u1ed1ng y khoa c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n h\u00f3a theo m\u1ee9c \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng huy\u1ebft v\u00e0 BMI.", "output_preview": "\u0110\u00e3 chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb 3 khuy\u1ebfn ngh\u1ecb gi\u00e1o d\u1ee5c l\u1ed1i s\u1ed1ng y khoa c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n h\u00f3a theo m\u1ee9c \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng huy\u1ebft v\u00e0 BMI."}, {"agent_id": "safety_agent", "agent_name": "Safety Agent", "status": "SUCCESS", "duration_ms": 1.0, "action_summary": "Safety Agent \u0111\u00e3 th\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ecbnh ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i: Kh\u00f4ng vi ph\u1ea1m quy chu\u1ea9n an to\u00e0n, \u0111\u00e3 g\u1eafn k\u00e8m tuy\u00ean b\u1ed1 mi\u1ec5n tr\u1eeb y t\u1ebf b\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c.", "output_preview": "Safety Agent \u0111\u00e3 th\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ecbnh ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i: Kh\u00f4ng vi ph\u1ea1m quy chu\u1ea9n an to\u00e0n, \u0111\u00e3 g\u1eafn k\u00e8m tuy\u00ean b\u1ed1 mi\u1ec5n tr\u1eeb y t\u1ebf b\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c."}], "total_duration_ms": 13.0}','2026-11-05 11:53:23.498865');
